    "turn_text": "so the timing just didn't work out. Looking bigger picture here, you think of a sports game, and you lose a close game, particularly a championship game, and fans of the losing team point to the refs. There was a call that was made, or a call that wasn't made, that could have swung the game in our favor. As part of this, claim of stolen election just because we've had very close elections this century.",
