    "turn_idx": 34,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, there is a line between sour grapes and a dangerous threat to democracy. And I think we saw that on January 6th of 2021. So again, looking at big picture, Congressman Space, how do we get beyond this? How do we restore the faith of all Americans in the system? Do we need a better system of casting and counting",
